# Regression proof: the new test fails before the fix and passes after it
# Same test body in both trees; bin/fm-wake-lib.sh and bin/fm-wake-drain.sh differ.

$ cd <base ddf98bc> && bash tests/.pm-newonly.sh
not ok - a contended queue lock failed the whole drain
exit: 1

$ cd <target dccad60> && bash tests/.pm-newonly.sh
ok - a queue-lock deadline without a named live holder is contention, not an unsafe lock
exit: 0
